  "description": "已验证 Benchmark 的指标快照。两个后端的测试参数与调用方式不同，不构成公平性能排名；不是实时压测或 GPU 监控。",
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "数据说明",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**这里展示的是已完成测试的快照，不是实时压测。**\n\n- **vLLM · API 快照**：通过 HTTP 接口测量；**TensorRT-LLM · Engine 快照**：直接运行 Engine。\n- 两次测试的输入/输出长度、请求数与调用路径不同，不能据此给后端排名。\n- 指标每 15 秒采集一次；结果文件未重新导出时，数值保持不变。快照年龄使用测试记录时间。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "指标采集状态",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=\"inferlab-node-exporter\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Node Exporter",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bool",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "离线",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "在线",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
